# ── Local Development ──────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values
# NEVER commit .env to GitHub
#
# ⚠️  NOTHING HERE IS PREFIXED WITH VITE_, AND THAT IS DELIBERATE.
# Vite inlines every VITE_-prefixed variable into the JavaScript bundle
# it ships to the browser. A key there is readable by anyone who opens
# devtools on the live site. Every key below is read by a Cloudflare
# Pages Function in functions/, server-side, and never reaches the client.

# ── AI providers (Story Teller + article translation) ──
# Groq      — English story generation.  https://console.groq.com
# Gemini    — Telugu / Hindi / Kannada.  https://ai.google.dev
# Anthropic — article translation.       https://console.anthropic.com
#
# Read by functions/api/story.js and functions/api/translate.js.
GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_your_groq_key_here
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your_key_here

# ── Google Cloud Text-to-Speech (Story Teller narration) ──
# Read by functions/api/tts.js. Falls back to browser speech synthesis
# when unset, so the feature degrades rather than breaking.
GOOGLE_TTS_KEY=your_google_tts_key_here

# ── Cashfree Payment Gateway (subscription gate) ──────
# Sign up: https://merchant.cashfree.com/merchants/login (no IEC needed
# for purely domestic INR flow). Generate test keys under
# Dashboard → Developers → API Keys.
#
# - CASHFREE_APP_ID is sent to the browser (via the create-order response)
#   so the SDK can identify which merchant to load — safe to expose.
# - CASHFREE_SECRET_KEY (or CASHFREE_API_KEY — both names are accepted)
#   MUST stay server-side. Never prefix with VITE_, never commit, never log.
# - CASHFREE_MODE controls which Cashfree environment we hit. Leave as
#   "test" until you've activated live mode in the dashboard.
CASHFREE_APP_ID=TEST_your_app_id_here
CASHFREE_SECRET_KEY=cfsk_ma_test_your_secret_here
CASHFREE_MODE=test

# ── Cloudflare Pages Production ────────────────────────
# Add these in Cloudflare Pages dashboard:
# Dashboard → Pages → ancientmahabharata
#   → Settings → Environment variables → Add variable
#
# Mark every one of these as "Encrypt".
#
# - GROQ_API_KEY            (Production, Preview)
# - GEMINI_API_KEY          (Production, Preview)
# - ANTHROPIC_API_KEY       (Production, Preview)
# - GOOGLE_TTS_KEY          (Production, Preview)
# - CASHFREE_APP_ID         (Production, Preview)
# - CASHFREE_SECRET_KEY     (Production, Preview)
# - CASHFREE_MODE           (Production = "live", Preview = "test")
# - BREVO_API_KEY           (already in use for newsletter)
# - BREVO_LIST_ID           (default "2")
#
# The old VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY, VITE_GROQ_API_KEY and VITE_GOOGLE_TTS_KEY
# variables are no longer read by anything — delete them from the
# dashboard, and rotate those keys: they were public in the bundle.
